---
source: crates/vextor-app/src/app/keys.rs
expression: "sheet(OperatingSystem::Mac)"
---
New: ⌘N
Open: ⌘O
Import: ⇧⌘I
Close: ⌘W
Save: ⌘S
Save As: ⇧⌘S
Export: ⇧⌘E
Undo: ⌘Z
Redo: ⇧⌘Z
Cut: ⌘X
Copy: ⌘C
Copy As SVG: ⇧⌘C
Paste: ⌘V
Paste in Place: ⇧⌘V
Duplicate: ⌘D
Delete: ⌫
Select All: ⌘A
Group: ⌘G
Ungroup: ⇧⌘G
Convert to Path: ⇧⌘P
Convert Text to Outlines: ⇧⌘O
Fit Artboard: ⌘0
Actual Size: ⌘1
Zoom In: ⌘+
Zoom Out: ⌘−
Show Grid: ⌘'
Next Document: ⌥⌘→
Previous Document: ⌥⌘←
Bring to Front: ⇧⌘↑
Bring Forward: ⌘↑
Send Backward: ⌘↓
Send to Back: ⇧⌘↓
Join: ⌘J
Straight ↔ Curve: C
Add Node: +
Delete Nodes: ⌫
Union: ⌥⌘U
Subtract: ⌥⌘S
Intersect: ⌥⌘I
Exclude: ⌥⌘E
